title: Ethics Committee
new-page: true
view-if: ethics_timer <= 0 and ethics_commitee_relation >= 60
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; ethics_timer += 6
is-card: true
card-image: img/Ethics_Committee.webp
tags: inter_affairs

= Ethics Committee

Our recent action has been questioned by the Ethics Committee whether our actions were following the frameworks in the code of ethics.

- @detailed: Provide detailed accounts of our actions.
- @root: Let's do this later.
- @easy_discard

@detailed
subtitle: -3 resources
choose-if: resources >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 3; ethics_commitee_relation += 20

We have provided detailed accounts that our actions were justified and within the framework of the code of ethics. The committee is satisfied.



